# Unsplash blanket-rejects unauthenticated/bot traffic on these
# photographer-credit badge links (401/403 depending on the request), which
# is not a broken link. lychee's --accept is global, not per-domain, so the
# only way to stop that from masking a real break elsewhere is to skip
# checking unsplash.com rather than accept the code everywhere. See
# .mega-linter.yml for the matching SPELL_LYCHEE_ARGUMENTS note.
unsplash\.com
